# game/chapter5.rpy:210
translate english chapter5_82aa1c68:

    # ms_iva "Maging malinaw tayo. Kayang-kaya kong makilala kung sino ang nagbasa mismo ng aktwal na teksto ng batas. \nIba ang pagkakasulat. Iba ang daloy ng lohika. \nAng AI-generated citations, malinis ang tunog, pero kulang sa texture ng tunay na pag-unawa ng tao."
    ms_iva "Let's be clear. I can easily tell who actually read the real text of the law. \nThe writing is different. The logic flows differently. \nAI-generated citations sound clean, but they lack the texture of genuine human understanding."

# game/chapter5.rpy:211
translate english chapter5_ad86c10c:

    # ms_iva "Ni-cite ng estudyanteng 'to ang RA 10173 Section 4 at nag-quote ng definition na hindi umiiral sa aktwal na batas. \nGinawa-gawa 'yun ng AI. At isinumite ng estudyante nang hindi na-check."
    ms_iva "This student cited RA 10173 Section 4 and quoted a definition that doesn't actually exist in the law. \nAI made that up. And the student submitted it without checking."

# game/chapter5.rpy:212
translate english chapter5_3ff0e4c3:

    # ms_iva "Matulog nang mahusay. Mag-aral nang mahusay. \nGisingin ang sarili ninyong utak bago ninyo hilingin sa isang makina, na mag-isip para sa inyo."
    ms_iva "Sleep well. Study well. \nWake up your own brain before you ask a machine to think for you."

# game/chapter5.rpy:213
translate english chapter5_dfdd6a21:

    # ms_iva "(mas mahinahon) ...Hindi ko 'to ginagawa para hulihin kayo. \nGinagawa ko 'to dahil balang araw, wala nang ibang titingin sa gawa ninyo bago ninyo ito ipasa. Only you guys will know it before the submission. Gusto ko lang kayong maging handa."
    ms_iva "(calmer now) ...I'm not doing this to catch you out. \nI'm doing this because someday, no one else will be checking your work before you submit it. Only you guys will know it before the submission. I just want you to be ready."

